sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 调用方/API
    participant R as Router
    participant P as ChapterPlanner
    participant S as ChapterScheduler
    participant W as ChapterWorker
    participant T as Tools<br/>(证据/自检)
    participant E as Evidence 注册表
    participant RV as ConsistencyReviewer
    participant AS as DocumentAssembler

    C->>R: request
    Note over R: RouteDecision{mode, reason}
    alt mode=fast
        R-->>C: AgentAnswer（聚焦问答，submit_answer 结束）
    else mode=supervisor
        R->>P: RouteDecision{mode=supervisor, reason}
        P->>S: DocumentPlan<br/>{title, deliverable_mode, chapters[]}
        loop 按依赖分波次（并发）
            S->>W: chapter + upstream<br/>{summary, decisions, claims}<br/>+ glossary + previous_attempt?
            loop ReAct 取证
                W->>T: search_knowledge(query, top_k≤20)
                T->>E: Dense + BM25 → RRF → resolve → merge
                E-->>T: Evidence[]（hash 防错配）
                T-->>W: previews [{E#, snippet≤600, section_path}]
                W->>T: read_evidence([E#...])
                T-->>W: quote(全文≤4000)<br/>或 budget_reached
            end
            W->>T: check_terminology(draft, glossary)
            T-->>W: {suspect_terms, count, advisory}
            W->>T: submit_chapter(ChapterSubmission)
            T-->>W: submitted / 校验失败→nudge
            W-->>S: ResearchPacket
        end
        S->>RV: packets[]
        RV-->>S: issues[]（error → 章节重修一次）
        S->>AS: packets(+revised) + issues
        AS-->>C: AgentAnswer<br/>{content=标准正文, evidence_ids, limitations}
    end